#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-followupreminderagent; is an akonadi agent which follow up reminder "
"mail"
msgstr ""
"&i18n-अनुवर्तनस्मरणकर्ता; एकः अकोनाडी एजेण्टः अस्ति यः स्मरणपत्रस्य अनुसरणं "
"करोति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:41
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &i18n-followupreminderagent;"
msgstr "&i18n-followupreminderagent इत्यस्य उपयोगेन;"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:43
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <menuchoice><guimenu>Options</guimenu><guimenuitem>Create Follow Up "
"Reminder</guimenuitem></menuchoice> in &kmail;'s composer window to open a "
"dialog which allows you to create a reminder to follow up your current "
"email at a specific date."
msgstr ""
"संवादं उद्घाटयितुं &kmail;इत्यस्य संगीतकारविण्डो मध्ये "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>विकल्पाः</guimenu><guimenuitem>अनुसरणं स्मरणं "
"रचयन्तु</guimenuitem></menuchoice> इत्यस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु यत् भवन्तं "
"स्वस्य वर्तमानस्य अनुसरणं कर्तुं स्मरणं निर्मातुं शक्नोति विशिष्टदिनाङ्के "
"ईमेलं कुर्वन्तु।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:48
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&i18n-followupreminderagent; Dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&i18n-अनुसरणस्मरणकर्ता; संवाद</screeninfo> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:54
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-followupreminderagent; Dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<वाक्यांश>&i18n-followupreminderagent; संवाद</phrase> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:57
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-followupreminderagent; Dialog</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-अनुवर्तनस्मरणकर्ता; संवाद</para>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:62
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the arrow-down button against the <guilabel>Date</guilabel> field to "
"select the date from the &kde; calendar widget. It is also possible to "
"choose your calender for the reminder using the <guilabel>Store ToDo "
"in</guilabel> drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"&kde; कैलेण्डर विजेट। <guilabel>Store ToDo in</guilabel> इति पतत्सूचीं "
"उपयुज्य स्मारकार्थं स्वस्य पञ्चाङ्गं चिन्वितुं अपि शक्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:63
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove reminders you have scheduled, use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure "
"&kmail;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> then select the "
"<guilabel>Plugins</guilabel> page in &kmail; and press the configuration "
"button against the <guilabel>Followup Reminder Agent</guilabel> item. Then "
"use the context menu launched with a &RMB; click on a reminder item to "
"select the <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> action."
msgstr ""
"भवता निर्धारितं स्मारकं निष्कासयितुं "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>&kmail;... "
"विन्यासः</guimenuitem></menuchoice> इत्यस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु ततः &kmail "
"मध्ये <guilabel>प्लगिन्स्</guilabel> पृष्ठं चिनोतु ; तथा "
"<guilabel>अनुवर्तन-स्मारक-एजेण्ट्</guilabel>-वस्तुनः विरुद्धं विन्यास-बटनं "
"नुदन्तु । ततः &RMB; <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> क्रियायाः चयनार्थं "
"स्मारकवस्तुं नुदन्तु ।"

